culation performance improvement](https://github.com/jarun/nnn/wiki/Performance#02-feb-2026)\r\n- [x] floating window\r\n  - render file stats (<kbd>f</kbd>) in a navigable floating window\r\n  - support rendering output of command run as plugin within floating window (prefix `>`)\r\n- [x] support in order fuzzy search\r\n- [x] with no selection, allow user input on _Copy here_ or _Move here_ e.g. to copy the system clipboard\r\n- [x] double confirm when removing more than 10 selected files using `rm`\r\n- [x] auto-complete hovered file name on pressing <kbd>TAB</kbd> at the end of prompt input\r\n- [x] fix: scroll down arrow indicator not showing when down arrow is pressed with filter\r\n- [x] fix: refresh directory after selection edits\r\n- [x] support PCRE2 compile-in (`make O_PCRE2=1`), remove PCRE1 support (no longer being developed)\r\n- [x] support jelliz in preview-tui\r\n- [x] history file for native prompt\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/jarun\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/sponsor-jarun-1eb0fc.svg\" alt=\"Sponsor\" /></a>\r\n</p>", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jarun/nnn/releases/286311812/reactions", "total_count": 41, "+1": 8, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 16, "confused": 0, "heart": 8, "rocket": 7, "eyes": 2}}